WEBVTT

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:59.770
"Sky Resort"

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:05.950
I overslept!

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:09.640
This is what I get for staying up late last night talking to Rina!

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.170
What am I doing?

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:15.790
It's still out for cleaning!

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:17.630
Rio...

00:02:17.630 --> 00:02:19.540
Senpai...

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:20.820
Why shrimp?

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.060
That looks good on you, senpai!

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.570
Thanks.

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:28.650
Rio, didn't you have anything else to wear?

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:31.480
I was in a hurry, so I just put on the first thing I saw.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:34.080
I don't think people would choose to wear that, though.

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:38.720
That's all. Thank you.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.920
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:45.860
You're all aware Sky Resort opens today, aren't you?

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:48.980
That triangular thing on top of the mountain?

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:51.350
That's right.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:57.800
It's Howard Resort's newest entertainment facility Sky Resort.

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:02.400
I intend to promote Sky Resort as the highest casino in the world.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:03.950
Highest?

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.200
High?

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.590
Do you mean the highest on this island?

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:14.540
I know it's sudden, but you'll be working at Sky Resort starting today.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.730
Be sure to give a tip-top performance in a tip-top location.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.650
Yes.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:24.900
There's no casino, but the world's highest city is Potosí at 4070 meters.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.880
We open tomorrow at noon.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:31.680
Until then, move your belongings to your new private rooms and get acquainted with the new casino.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:32.630
Yes.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:37.470
Jiggling boxing and greasy lotion wrestling...

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:41.290
These events leave something to be desired for the opening.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.390
Busty beach flag contest...

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:46.580
It makes them sound kind of fat, but how does "bursting" sound?

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:51.480
What about beautiful dealer sisters dynamite?

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.560
No one would have any idea what that is.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:57.170
Maybe I should go with Dead or Alive paradise.

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:05.040
The view from this elevator amazes me every time I see it.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.710
This is rather sudden.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:09.310
There's supposed to be some kind of surprise.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:12.670
I've never been there. I'm looking forward to going tomorrow.

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:16.620
I can't believe we have to move before then.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.650
You don't have that much stuff.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.560
You're right. Ania?

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.310
What is it?

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:23.620
Your luggage.

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:28.390
That's not what we meant.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:37.040
It looks like people have already arrived.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.930
It's amazing.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:44.710
The casino must be up there.

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:49.080
It's been closed until now. This is our first time here, too.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:57.340
I can see the ocean outside, Rio-senpai.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:05:00.100
What's on this side?

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.120
Are you okay?

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:06.680
Yes, I'm used to falling.

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:08.530
Welcome. I've been waiting for you.

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.370
Who are you?

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:16.650
I am Linda, a Sky Resort dealer.

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:20.530
The owner told me to show you around.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:21.650
Come with me!

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:24.480
Ask me anything about Sky Resort.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:27.600
Are those clothes the owner's taste?

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:31.820
First I'll show you Sky Resort's casino.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.950
It's amazing.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:35.370
Everything's shiny.

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:37.370
Doesn't it sparkle?

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.870
Your Howard Resort.

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:49.450
Senpai...

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:50.700
Amazing.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.140
What do you think?

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:56.320
Let's keep going.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.140
What is this hall?

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:02.210
It's a hologram theater.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.600
You can explore all kinds of worlds from right here.

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:14.610
Be careful you don't fall.

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:15.900
Let's keep going.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:17.840
There's more?

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.840
What an amazing virtual space.

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:21.220
It's like the real thing.

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:23.170
In some ways, it is the real thing.

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:24.710
What happens if we fall?

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:26.060
It might hurt.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:29.320
There's a safety system in place, so you probably won't die.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.270
I see.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:39.050
Rio, what's going on?

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:42.480
Things keep happening when Linda snaps her fingers.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:43.760
I don't know.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:44.750
What's this?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:49.840
This is another one of Sky Resort's attractions, the extreme slider.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:54.450
These tubes run all over Sky Resort.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:57.640
It's the world's longest slider.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.350
Looks like fun.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.490
Sky Resort is an amazing place.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:07.080
Some of the attractions aren't fully functional yet, but I think you get the idea.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:07.870
Yeah.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:10.540
Huh? Some people are hopeless.

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:13.960
Someone left this here, and we're opening tomorrow.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:17.410
Let's keep going.

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:25.370
Linda-san must be really strong.

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:29.060
She's more than just strong.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:31.620
You're right. Who is she?

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.500
Is there something you want to know?

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:36.560
Linda-san!

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.770
Are you all right?

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:45.960
It came off.

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:54.780
The lock on my neck has been loosening every time I hit my back since yesterday.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.980
Are you a robot?

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:58.830
Yup.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.730
A dealer robot...

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:05.640
I'm also Sky Resort's main computer terminal.

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:09.910
That's why you could do all that by snapping your fingers.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:13.730
Couldn't you do that without snapping?

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:15.870
You got me.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:18.240
That explains it.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:21.030
What'd you do that for?

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:23.400
I'm sorry.

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:25.670
I made a comeback.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:29.090
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.340
Stop! It won't taste good!

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:37.910
My hair isn't made of broccoli!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.410
You'll find something much more delicious in this invitation...

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.530
Cauliflower!

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:46.820
A new legend has been added to Howard Resort today.

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:48.930
Its name is Sky Resort.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.310
Made with top-of-the-line technology...

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:58.370
this new age resort is sure to lead the casino world...

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:57.280
Rosa-san must be disappointed.

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:01.560
I know. I can't believe she has a photo shoot on an important day like this.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:01.720
no, the entertainment industry.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:05.010
I, Tom Howard, promise you this.

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:11.920
Sky Resort will shock and move you like never before.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:16.300
I've got work to do at the main unit. See you later.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:19.520
Is she supposed to be high tech?

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:21.400
She's a fun girl.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.930
I'm looking forward to working with her.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.540
Birds of a feather flock together.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.970
Yeah, you both trip all the time.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:29.950
That was a little direct.

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.920
It doesn't bother me.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.270
What doesn't?

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:37.550
Stories of the experiences you'll have will be told for generations.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:39.460
What a long speech.

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:41.400
Let's get started.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.670
I'm ready any time.

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:03.070
Ladies and gentlemen, Sky Resort is open!

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:40.870
What's going on?

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:41.660
An earthquake?

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:45.610
Senpai, we have a problem!

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:47.880
The ground is falling away!

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.130
What?

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.330
I don't believe it.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.410
We're climbing higher and higher into the sky.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:01.730
That's why this place is the Sky Resort.

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:03.640
Of course.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:13.440
Ladies and gentlemen, please enter.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.040
This is Sky Resort!

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:44.530
Has the increase of internal load been confirmed yet?

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:47.580
How is the entrance counter?

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:51.240
Three circles, good. No one's been left behind.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.110
Everyone's inside.

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:56.010
Now to lock the entrance.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:02.550
Entrance locked.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:04.460
How's the sky?

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:09.620
Course clear. Systems all green.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.370
Sky Resort, blast off!

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:27.420
Altitude 500 feet.

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:34.460
We're floating, we're floating!

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.510
This is amazing!

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:37.260
I can't believe this giant thing floats!

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:39.530
It's a flying casino!

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:42.880
Welcome to Sky Resort.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:53.900
I knew you would go on a journey, Rio-kun...

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:13.250
That should do it.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.420
Huh?

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:19.630
This place has restricted access. You can't come in here.

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:20.880
Are you lost?

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:25.450
No, I have business with you.

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:34.660
Sky Resort, the world's highest casino.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:42.980
This enormous building has overturned the norm to become a flying palace of entertainment.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:47.260
Enjoy yourselves at this cool and spectacular casino.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.910
I won again.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:17.160
Me, too.

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:19.890
Congratulations.

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:25.450
This luck must come from being in a floating casino so close to heaven.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:28.940
No, it's got to be the goddess of victory standing in front of us.

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:32.030
The goddess of victory's as strong as ever today.

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:34.300
I still think it's because we're close to heaven.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:40.350
There you go again. Go easy on us, Rina-chan.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:44.760
Even up here you cannot grab the clouds, but you should be able to grab luck.

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:46.180
You think so?

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:47.560
Would you like to continue?

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:49.200
One more.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:49.830
Very well.

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:57.690
I'm sorry!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:01.740
Linda-san.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:04.470
What?

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:10.450
Rio!

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:15.320
Rio-chan, Rio-chan.

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:20.850
Rio-chan, I challenge you. I challenge you.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.200
Challenge?

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:24.800
That's a...

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:28.970
To a gate battle, of course. A gate battle, of course.

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:29.930
A gate?

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:32.760
That's right, a gate battle. A gate battle.

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:36.080
I challenge you. Challenge you.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.920
Again...

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:40.390
Something's off about Linda.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:43.970
Amazing, Linda-san. You're a gate holder, too.

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:46.610
I'm a gate holder. A holder.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:47.820
She repeated herself again.

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:48.970
Repeated herself.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:50.290
A gate battle?

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.070
Accept her challenge!

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.900
It looks like he's getting started.

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:55.780
Getting started.

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:57.000
Owner...

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:59.760
I've been waiting for this kind of event!

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:07.000
This historic first flight of Sky Resort can only be celebrated with a gate battle!

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:11.210
Does this mean I have to do it?

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:14.860
This is all for the guests who have come today.

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:18.150
Rio, what's our resort's motto?

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:20.390
"As the customer wishes."

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:21.970
It's decided, then.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.170
You can do it, Rio.

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.240
Owner, how will they battle?

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:31.050
On Sky Resort's extreme slider, of course.

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:52.330
This suit is ridiculous. Won't it come off?

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.600
You two look great.

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:56.150
Thank you.

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:59.080
Work hard for the guests, you two.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.030
Yes.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:01.380
Hello, everyone.

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:07.200
Today I am bringing you the gate battle between Rio-senpai and Linda-san from Sky Resort.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:09.370
I am your announcer Ania Helsing.

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:12.730
Your commentators are Mint-san, Choco-san, and Tiffany-san.

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:14.440
It's a pleasure to be here.

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:19.270
The participants will be betting the two or one gates they hold.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:23.120
Let us watch Elle-san and Ille-san slide on the...

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:38.620
The first to ride down the extreme slider and cross the finish line wins.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:42.690
The slider features a variety of possible courses.

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:49.210
While every course is approximately the same length, different courses have different slopes and average speeds...

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:52.170
so choosing the right course will be key in winning this race.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:56.610
There are even some courses that must not be chosen. If you do...

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.370
We're about to start.

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.180
I won't lose. Won't lose.

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:16.180
Something's wrong with you, Linda-san.

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:17.470
Rio!

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.900
It's a gate battle! Focus!

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:21.970
You can do it!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:26.150
Here's the countdown!

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:29.140
5... 4... 3...

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:32.330
2... 1... 0!

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.910
They're still close after their starting dash!

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:48.390
Does her extensive knowledge of Sky Resort give Linda-san an advantage in this battle, Mint-san?

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:53.120
Possibly, but Rio is Howard Resort's goddess of victory.

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:55.720
I believe she will win!

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:59.840
The course is beginning to branch.

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:11.650
Rio effectively used the steep slider to suddenly increase her speed.

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:16.380
Rio-senpai has chosen the casino course while Linda-san has entered the pool course.

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:35.300
Linda is catching up.

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:37.700
The next fork is coming up.

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:44.970
Excellent! Senpai has chosen the superior sky course!

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:46.120
Is it really better?

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.240
Probably...

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.940
Uh, oh. She's got quite a lead.

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:06.520
All right.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:17.540
Go, go!

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:20.130
I won't lose, I won't lose!

00:20:22.140 --> 00:20:23.750
Impressive.

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:28.850
Linda-san has manipulated Sky Resort's main computer to surge ahead.

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:31.850
She's catching up to Rio-senpai.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:36.150
She's caught up! She's caught her!

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:38.820
What an amazing dead heat!

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:40.990
Rio...

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:46.980
The two are now approaching the goal!

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:49.280
Who will win?

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.750
Goal!

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:58.100
The winner is Lin...

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:02.770
It came off again.

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:04.020
Are you okay?

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:05.500
Thank you.

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:07.540
Goal!

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:09.940
The winner is Rio-senpai!

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:12.770
Huh? Oh, thank you...

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:16.350
You did it, Rio!

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:19.050
Congratulations, Rio-senpai!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:22.800
She got lucky.

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:26.090
Now that I've let the other one go, I don't need her any more.

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.720
What have I been doing?

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:34.310
Rio-chan, why are you wearing a swimsuit?

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:43.530
So you're responsible for Linda's actions.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:47.370
Thank you for the entertaining event, Cartia.

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:51.390
It's good to see you again, Mister Howard.

00:23:26.980 --> 00:23:29.680
Little boy, are you Mint's friend?

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:31.620
I'm every good kid's friend.

00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:34.740
You're a bad girl, so I'll have to deal with you.

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:36.220
A bad girl?

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:40.370
"Roll Ruler"

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:38.890
You can count on me in the next episode!
